{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"924cd7d428b2e46be33b9f00dc48f13aaa7d98712ac96a96f65b262d5058681e","digest":{"component_or_area":"identity entity + authorship certification + provider-neutral user mapping","key_entities":["identity ticket-type","create_placeholder(provider, external_id, display_name)","rebar.authorship.v1","author_id","rebar verify-identity","identity.require_authenticated","identity.enforce_since","verify_signature_result.schema.json","key_not_valid_at_era","added_at_commit","revoked_at_commit","intra_idx","application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json","event_append.stage_and_commit","event_append.batch_stage_and_commit","hlc.next_tick","src/rebar/_commands/_seam.py","session_log","Modify Reporter permission","Browse users and groups permission","GET /rest/api/3/user/search"],"problem_keywords":["authenticated identity","authorship attestation","provider-neutral user mapping","key validity era","tofu","key rotation","dsse signing","jira accountId mapping","opt-in enforcement","ci merge gate","placeholder auto-upgrade","compaction survival","private-key guard","verdict enum"],"propositions":["Ticket events attribute to an unauthenticated forgeable git config author, so a real-person identity entity with signed authorship is needed for auditable, non-repudiable attribution.","An identity is a first-class event-sourced entity storing name, email, {provider, external_id} mappings, and public keys only, with a write-time guard rejecting private-key material.","Authorship signatures use a DSSE envelope wrapping an in-toto Statement whose subject binds {event_uuid, content_hash}; unavailable signing keys yield an unsigned Tier-0 write that never blocks.","Key validity era is defined by tickets-branch commit ancestry refined by intra_idx, with TOFU self-signed genesis and G2 requiring key add/rotate/revoke be signed by a currently-valid key.","Provider-neutral mapping keys on the provider's opaque stable id (Jira accountId, never email), with best-effort bootstrap, operator-mapping fallback, and placeholder auto-upgrade for unmapped inbound users.","Opt-in enforcement runs rebar verify-identity --require-authenticated in a CI merge-gate over the merged log, failing on unsigned/unverified events after the enforce_since cutover while grandfathering earlier events and never rejecting replay."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785204838640912471,"uuid":"be3a1511-fb95-4ed1-97d0-7d31498e6628"}